{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"text":"BOOL","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"handleOpenURL:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSURL","text":"NSURL"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"url"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The URL to process."}]}],"name":"url"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YES if the URL was handled by Pushwoosh, NO otherwise."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Handles special Pushwoosh URLs, primarily used for:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Test device registration","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Register device for push testing via QR code"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Deep link tracking"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Process tracked deep links from push notifications"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Should be called from your app’s URL handling methods. Returns YES if the URL"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"was a Pushwoosh URL and was handled, NO if it should be processed by your app.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Example","level":2,"text":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Handle URLs in SceneDelegate (iOS 13+):","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["class SceneDelegate: UIResponder, UIWindowSceneDelegate {","","    func scene(_ scene: UIScene, openURLContexts URLContexts: Set<UIOpenURLContext>) {","        guard let url = URLContexts.first?.url else { return }","","        \/\/ First, check if Pushwoosh handles this URL","        if Pushwoosh.configure.handleOpenURL(url) {","            Logger.info(\"URL handled by Pushwoosh\")","            return","        }","","        \/\/ Handle other deep links","        DeepLinkRouter.shared.handle(url)","    }","","    func scene(_ scene: UIScene, continue userActivity: NSUserActivity) {","        guard userActivity.activityType == NSUserActivityTypeBrowsingWeb,","              let url = userActivity.webpageURL else { return }","","        if Pushwoosh.configure.handleOpenURL(url) {","            return","        }","","        UniversalLinkRouter.shared.handle(url)","    }","}","","\/\/ Legacy AppDelegate support","class AppDelegate: UIApplicationDelegate {","","    func application(_ app: UIApplication,","                    open url: URL,","                    options: [UIApplication.OpenURLOptionsKey: Any] = [:]) -> Bool {","","        if Pushwoosh.configure.handleOpenURL(url) {","            return true","        }","","        return DeepLinkRouter.shared.handle(url)","    }","}"]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/handleopenurl:"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/handleOpenURL:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Processes deep link URLs for Pushwoosh SDK functionality."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)handleOpenURL:","roleHeading":"Type Method","title":"handleOpenURL:","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"handleOpenURL:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"handleOpenURL:"}]},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/handleOpenURL:":{"abstract":[{"text":"Processes deep link URLs for Pushwoosh SDK functionality.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"handleOpenURL:","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/handleopenurl:","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"handleOpenURL:"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/handleOpenURL:","title":"handleOpenURL:","role":"symbol"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","role":"collection","title":"PushwooshCore","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","title":"PWConfiguration","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PWConfiguration"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","role":"symbol","abstract":[]}}}